OL,3,ARare turtles found inside baggage at
OL,4,AAmsterdam airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwenty-six "very rare" turtles have
OL,7,Fbeen seized from a traveller's checked
OL,8,Fbaggage at Amsterdam's Schiphol
OL,9,Fairport, a Dutch government agency has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe Netherlands Food and Consumer
OL,13,FProduct Safety Authority (NVWA) said a
OL,14,Fman flying from Mexico to Hong Kong via
OL,15,Fthe airport was arrested on Saturday
OL,16,Fafter the Vallarta mud turtles were
OL,17,Ffound by customs officers.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
